  "description_short": "Central Mossel Bay café and cocktail bar blending quality coffee, fresh meals, and evening drinks in a relaxed setting.",
  "description_long": "Tucked along Marsh Street in the heart of Mossel Bay, Royal Blue Lounge Cafe brings together the best of café culture and cocktail bar vibes under one roof. Whether you're stopping in for a morning cappuccino and pastry, settling in for a leisurely lunch, or meeting friends for sundowners, the relaxed atmosphere makes it easy to linger.\n\nThe menu covers all bases—good coffee, freshly prepared meals, and a well-stocked bar for when the sun goes down. It's the kind of spot that works for a quick bite, a proper meal, or just a drink while you watch Mossel Bay go by. The central location makes it convenient whether you're a local or exploring the town.\n\nWith a solid reputation among regulars and a laid-back approach to service, Royal Blue strikes a comfortable balance between café and bar. It's unpretentious, welcoming, and consistently delivers what it promises.",
